.TH SQ 1 1.4.0 "Sequoia PGP" "User Commands"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sq\-version \- Detailed version and output version information
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.br
\fBsq version\fR [\fIOPTIONS\fR]  
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Detailed version and output version information.
.PP
With no further options, this command lists the version of `sq`, the version of the underlying OpenPGP implementation `sequoia\-openpgp`, and which cryptographic library is used.
.PP

.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Global options"
See \fBsq\fR(1) for a description of the global options.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.nh
\fBsq\fR(1).
.hy
.PP
For the full documentation see <https://book.sequoia\-pgp.org>.
.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
1.4.0
